  "note": "Each shot: id (image name), as (demo login first name, or coach), size, path, steps, brand (green = Entrayn green; coach = the demo coach's own branding), writes (true only if the screen must save something), full (whole page), tall (a taller window, in pixels, for screens that scroll inside the app), articles (which help articles use it). card (just one card: {\"text\": ...} or {\"css\": ...}). Steps: click, clickIf (only if it is there), waitText (with optional timeout), wait.",
